WEBVTT

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.020
You must be the thief of the capital, Hakamadare.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.830
Yeah. I was surprised when this was suddenly delivered to me.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.260
Tenkaimaru, the big boss

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:28.540
that controls the thieves of the old Southern capital.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:34.410
I hear he is a man of honor who only attacks aristocrats.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:39.380
What does a bigshot like him want with me?

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.280
Talk to the boss if you want to know.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.680
Enter.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.630
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:59.130
Hakamadare, previously known as Fujiwarano Yasusuke.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.870
For what reason did you toss aside your name?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.570
A foolish question.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:07.700
Can one save the weak with a name?

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:14.280
It seems my eyes made no mistake.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.550
I've heard of your endeavors in the capital.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.760
Looks like the rumors were true.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:25.420
Hakamadare, I wish to speak with one such as you.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:47.920
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:55.920
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:03.130
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:12.170
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:29.330
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:37.260
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:47.270
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:53.410
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:58.030
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:03.030
"ZANGA"

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Problems have arisen recently.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.500
It seems, the Rajou gates are no longer strong enough to protect us.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:21.210
The new gates of Suzaku Avenue, the Raise gates, will soon be complete.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.510
Finish it as quickly as possible.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:24.510
Yes.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:31.420
With Haruaki-<i>dono</i>'s <i>onmyou</i> spells, the gates will be impenetrable.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.350
By Haruaki-<i>dono</i>?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:39.430
We have to have you protect the Light Palace, Yasunori-<i>dono.</i>

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:43.870
With this, no evil spirit will be allowed to set foot inside.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.400
The defense of the capital...

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.940
No, the Light Palace, will be iron-clad.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.910
But it is still not enough.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.380
The Golden Armor?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:59.710
Tadano Shinbochi promised to bequeath it upon his son, Yorinobu,

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.750
so he could become your strength.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.620
However, that is not what came to be.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:08.890
The one called Raiko has inherited the armor

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:13.160
and lives with Haruaki's granddaughter, Seimei.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:20.640
Could that be why you want to have Seimei as your own?

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.770
Correct. I wish to protect this Light Palace.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.440
Then we should bring those two in immediately!

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:31.150
There is no point in forcing them here.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.850
Seimei would never obey that way.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.520
And it seems that the one called Raiko,

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:40.590
cannot use his power without Seimei by his side.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.090
Quite a difficult situation.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.160
If I may be so bold to say,

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.600
there are Makai Knights other than the Golden Knight.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.370
Like the Golden Armor that is passed down the Minamoto family,

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:57.670
the Southern Fujiwara family carries the Silver Armor.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:58.940
Hoh.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:03.040
However, the whereabouts of the armor is currently unknown.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:09.520
It is said that one of the branch families has inherited it.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.520
You will look for it?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.780
Most definitely!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.190
Not my life! Not my life!

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:23.200
Oops. That's enough noise outta you.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.720
Found it!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.430
A huge stash, just like the rumors.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.910
Wait! That is our family's entire fortune!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.240
Shut up!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:39.050
Our boss, Hakamadare-<i>sama</i>, forbids killing,

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.320
so we weren't planning to take your lives.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.880
But if you keep screaming like that...

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:52.030
A ball? Like the ones used for <i>kemari</i>?

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.220
Huh?

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.550
Our gang is done for!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.790
Not just the group that attacked the mansion on Gojou Highway.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.390
Last night, nine people were killed!

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:26.690
You idiot!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.470
I didn't ask you what happened on yesterday's raid.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.370
Don't do things on your own.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.700
I'm the one who decides which aristocrat's house we attack.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:42.210
I was thinking that maybe another gang is behind this?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:46.080
I'm saying other groups are looking down on us.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.450
Aren't you a little too lax, Boss?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.920
Don't kill. Only steal from aristocrats.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.490
To top it off, give the poor charity if you see them.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.460
It's like we're trying to fix the world.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.460
What are we? We're thieves!

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.670
You're right. We're thieves.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:10.440
But is there some law that says thieves can't give out charity?

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.410
That being said, we don't back down. We fight back.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.410
Boss!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.910
That was the work of a monster.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.650
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:27.860
An evil spirit killed everyone with a weird <i>kemari</i> ball.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.620
<i>Kemari</i>?

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.050
<i>--Kemari</i>?
--The <i>kemari</i> ball game?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.830
--There's no way.
--No way.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.200
Shut up!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.530
Killing with a <i>kemari</i> ball, huh?

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:42.990
That definitely isn't the work of a human.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.340
It must be the work of a Horror.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.680
The Silver Armor?

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.460
Yes, it is something passed down the Fujiwara family.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:04.390
The armor is always passed down in secret.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.990
Due to the method and the passage of time,

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:12.870
I am not even sure if it truly exists.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:17.170
I see. You want to know where it went.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:20.240
There are a few possible candidates.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.810
You should go down this list.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.150
Really?!

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:29.220
Hm? Shake?

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:32.720
I am not a dog.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.520
Money. Such a tough woman.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.360
Thank you!

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:49.100
It's fine to make a gate, but in a place like this?

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:53.940
The aristocrats are only thinking of protecting the Light Palace.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.140
I see. Him?

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:33.450
Yes! My little brother, Yasusuke.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.610
Yasusuke, come here!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.090
Yasusuke, is it?

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:44.090
I hear the young service candidates are excellent this year.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.900
Mikado is quite pleased as well.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:52.430
Devote yourself. It will be a great honor to be chosen.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:54.900
It will also open a path to success.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.340
Yes!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.960
Wait, Narimichi.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.630
Why did you push yourself so far?

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:00.200
If it weren't for you...

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.240
I should have been the first to be chosen!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.980
You'll have another chance.
The injury isn't that bad, is it?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.880
There is no next year for youth selection!

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.390
It has been a long time.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:29.430
I'm happy that you even remembered the mansion.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.670
Narimichi. It was you, after all.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.740
I heard you died during an epidemic.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:39.740
I'm so happy to see a friend again.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:43.510
When I heard it was a <i>kemari</i> ball...

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:48.020
Why did you attack my men, instead of me directly?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:52.520
I wanted to play <i>kemari</i> with you again without interruption.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.250
Just like in the past.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.130
What's wrong? Let's enjoy ourselves.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.800
What is so fun about this?

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.300
It's not fun?

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:07.270
Or are you saying that
I'm not good enough for you?

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.740
If that's the case...

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:18.280
Will this make things fun for you?

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:21.580
So you really did become a Horror.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.780
Let's enjoy ourselves.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.840
Yasusuke! Are you hurt?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.030
Y-You're...

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.250
Silver armor, you say?

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.660
Do you know anything about it?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:14.430
I have asked various branches of the family.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.590
You are the only person left, Toshinaga-<i>dono.</i>

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:22.670
Do you know of it?

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.910
Though I know of it, I have never seen it.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:29.740
I heard it was passed down
Fujiwarano Tokitada's family.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.350
Fujiwarano Tokitada? If that's the case...

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:34.750
That's right.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.250
Tokitada fell into Michinaga's disfavor.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:42.090
He was cut off from any advancement and disappeared from the capital.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:46.990
It is armor that no one has actually seen.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.600
Its possible existence has only been passed down by word of mouth.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:55.700
With Tokitada gone, there is no one...

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.500
Thank you very much.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.780
Well, that was a big surprise.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:06.110
I never imagined that you were the Golden Knight, Raiko.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.350
Right? Right?

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:13.890
Makai Knights pass their armor down their worthy bloodlines.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:16.990
Family, huh? How stupid.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:21.800
Do you know anything about that Horror or evil spirit?

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.630
Does he live in this house?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.030
What will you do once you know?

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:28.200
He will find and eliminate it, of course.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:32.340
It is my duty to protect the people from evil spirits.

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:35.640
I see. But, stay back.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.680
I will take care of this myself.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:39.510
No way!

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:42.920
You may be a skilled warrior, but a normal human can't take him.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.390
Leave it to us.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.510
You're being too pesky, Raiko.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.230
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:14:55.230 --> 00:15:00.100
Did you notice what he had on his arm?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.930
No way, right?

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.580
Why didn't you tell him?

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.070
Like I could.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.520
I am Tenkaimaru.

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:20.590
I was once called Fujiwarano Tokitada.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:25.130
I have tossed aside my aristocracy and live among the weak.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:31.090
I never thought a man with the same ideals would appear in my bloodline.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:48.380
Don't hold it with brute force, but with your heart and soul.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:52.320
If you do, it will become as light as a feather.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:57.320
Being able to hold this
Makai sword is the first step.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:02.100
You must learn to control this blade freely.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.270
Hey, what are you deciding on your own?

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:08.440
Normally, I would have you undergo heavy training.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.810
However, I do not have much time left.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:14.110
You...

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:19.680
This guy will train you in my place.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:23.080
You must face yourself, Hakamadare.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.150
Even if you turn your back from the path of aristocracy,

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:29.290
you cannot escape your own destiny.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:33.160
Your fate as one who protects.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:38.630
He just said whatever he wanted.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:45.170
Just when I finally thought
I was free to do what I want.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:47.810
A child of the Fujiwara family.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:48.880
Yeah.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:54.850
I tossed aside my family name, but couldn't fully become a thief.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:59.020
You're saying someone like me is one who protects?

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.220
This joke isn't even funny.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.150
So you appeared.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.460
Let's enjoy some <i>kemari.</i>

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.230
Narimichi, why did you do it?

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.070
Huh?

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:16.570
Didn't you advance in the ranks quite well?

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.370
What made you become a Horror?!

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.080
Quite well?

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.550
Maybe that's how others saw it!

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:30.020
But it wasn't enough to match my birth, potential, and skill!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.220
Not at all enough!

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.850
Status! House!

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.690
That! This!

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.220
Since I was young!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:42.060
Like the moon of the mid-autumn festival, my life was perfect!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:47.430
Until that day! Everything started from that sprained ankle!

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:55.500
In the end, I was even told that
I would die from a passing epidemic!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:02.850
I see. So it's true that you died from sickness.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:09.880
Everything is your fault!
My life was ruined because of you!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.390
I don't care if you hold a grudge against me.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:18.630
But that's no reason to become a Horror!

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.600
Social advancement and the size of your house!

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:23.200
Tied down by the life of aristocracy,

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.210
you fell for such worthless things.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:28.970
Yeah, that's why I feel great now!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.310
You're pretty good.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:36.780
As expected from the first chosen during the youth service selection.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:40.390
Why are you making that face?
Are you afraid of death?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:47.390
No, you became a Horror because you rotted from your very soul.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.830
It just really saddens me.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:57.570
Pity? Don't joke around!
A mere powerless human like you!

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:01.410
What?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.580
Stop! Narimichi!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:12.320
Your subordinates!
The candidates from the selection!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:16.850
All of them! All of them!
I'm going to devour them all!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.970
Is that you, Yasusuke?

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.200
Brother?!

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:28.370
Oh, you!

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:32.770
Perfect timing, thanks for everything!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:39.180
If you didn't incite
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>, I would have...!

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.880
I'll devour you!

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.120
Quell my hunger!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:46.380
Atone for that day!

00:19:54.530 --> 00:20:01.240
We didn't have much time, but you survived the harsh training well.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:04.500
Yeah, I thought I was going to be murdered.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.050
You've gotten a good look in your face.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.580
Are you prepared?

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:28.920
Now, go! The new Silver Knight who inherits my armor!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.200
My name is Zanga!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:35.730
I am a Makai Knight that eliminates Horrors...

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.010
...such as you!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:04.130
Impossible. Yasusuke?

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:17.810
According to the Watchdog Center, it should be around here.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.480
Seimei!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:21.640
Let's go.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:55.240
Amazing.

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:58.650
Who is that?

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:16.830
A Makai Knight.

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:45.130
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:52.310
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:02.820
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:06.250
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:09.390
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:16.790
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:23.790
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:30.180
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:37.420
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:40.720
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:48.420
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.040
"Next Episode: CONFLICT"

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:56.730
The unchanging weight of the hanging scale.

00:23:56.730 --> 00:24:00.640
If one of side is chosen, the other will overflow.
